    Q("Why do some squid squirt glowing ink?", "to get away safely", ["to attract smaller fish", "to signal to their family", "to light up the sea floor"], "'To confuse attackers while they escape.'", ["That's the anglerfish's trick.", "Family isn't mentioned.", "Lighting the floor isn't mentioned."]),
    Q("What is special about firefly flashes?", "each type flashes differently", ["they only flash underwater", "they warn other insects", "they use sunlight"], "'Each species has its own code.'", ["Fireflies live on land.", "They flash to attract a partner.", "It's a chemical reaction, not sunlight."]),
