    Q("What surprises outsiders?", "competitors help one another", ["players keep their newest tricks to themselves", "the games are very short", "records are rarely broken"], "'Rivals routinely share newly discovered tricks.'", ["It's the opposite: they share.", "They spend thousands of hours.", "Shaving seconds means records do fall."]),
